            "value": "通話状態の表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show call status on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island without names. Turning this off or dismissing the display does not end your call.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show call status on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island without names. Turning this off or dismissing the display does not end your call."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前を表示せず、ロック画面とDynamic Islandに通話状態を表示します。この設定をオフにしたり表示を閉じたりしても、通話は終了しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call status could not be displayed. Your call can continue. Turn the display off and on to retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Call status could not be displayed. Your call can continue. Turn the display off and on to retry."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通話状態を表示できませんでした。通話は続けられます。再試行するには表示を一度オフにしてからオンにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The displayed call has ended or changed. Open RideIntercom to check your current call.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The displayed call has ended or changed. Open RideIntercom to check your current call."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示していた通話は終了したか、別の通話に変わりました。RideIntercomを開いて現在の通話を確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld kbps (Lower Quality)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld kbps（音質低下）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AAC-ELD choices depend on the sample rate. Unsupported values are adjusted to the nearest quality-preserving choice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AAC-ELDの選択肢はサンプルレートによって変わります。非対応の値は、音質を保つ選択肢の中で最も近い値へ補正します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "48 kHz / 32 kbps and 24 kHz / 16 kbps are lower-quality options. They do not change the default. Encoding bitrate is not total network usage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "48 kHz・32 kbpsと24 kHz・16 kbpsは、音質低下を伴う選択肢です。既定値は変わりません。符号化ビットレートは通信全体の使用量ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
